        "original_id": "17fc427b-012b-5524-90f7-d3fbc8bdb3d7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Signet Jewelers, Zale Corporation, Sterling Jewelers\n- Brands: Zales, Kay Jewelers, Jared\n- Places: Delaware, United Kingdom, New York Stock Exchange\n\nFacts:\n- In 1987, Signet Jewelers Limited acquired Sterling Jewelers, making Sterling Jewelers a wholly owned subsidiary.\n- In 1993, Zale Corporation was incorporated in Delaware as an American jewelry retailer.\n- Signet Jewelers owns and operates the companies Zales, Kay Jewelers, and Jared.\n- Signet Jewelers Limited is based in the United Kingdom and is listed on the New York Stock Exchange under the symbol SIG.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
